  "structural_change": "LH-P3UNITS/FUSED n4: n3 gate FAILED (textbook REFUSE 113,400 flops on one root > 110,000 and one reset relay flop driving 16,053 async loads; CTS stalled > 14,400 s in hold repair on the 20x11 rmeta flop chain). n4 halves the datapath instead of squeezing: the HC_PRE_NORM mix = the first three sums of the HC_POST chain, so one f12 product/sum chain per element serves both ops (ot_hnx_fused_el2; -4 multipliers -3 adders -18-deep delays per column); every delay >= 4 deep is an ot_hdc_delay_ring (no flop-to-flop hold chain); ot_rst_relay REGIONS 9 (one kept copy per element column + control); PARALLEL fallback outline = the DIE f4c_t9p3 lane slot 345.6 x 648 (util ~0.40 if the n4 estimate holds; covers an under-estimate)"
 },
